# move_drvicon regression -- desktop icon -> empty desktop space reposition
# (act_bdown's DESKWH->DESKWH branch, bypasses fun_drag entirely). Drag the
# C: icon from its home cell (0,0) to an empty cell at grid (2,0), centre
# (220,35) (76x40 icon box at (182,19), g_icw=91, g_ich=46).
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 38 35
2100 down
2900 drag 120 35
3500 drag 180 35
4100 drag 220 35
4900 up
5500 parkbr
6300 mark B_MOVED
